---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Rent Assessment Advisory" description="Evidence-based rent valuation for your property under Ghana's Act 220. Know the lawful rent before you serve notice.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="/services/" style="color:#516784; text-decoration:none; margin-bottom:1rem; display:inline-block;">← Back to Services</a>

      <h1>Rent Assessment Advisory</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="max-width:680px; margin-bottom:2rem;">Get a written, evidence-based position on the lawful rent your property can command under Ghana's Rent Act, 1963 (Act 220) — before you serve notice on your tenant.</p>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f0f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Why You Need This Service</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Many landlords struggle with one question: <strong>What rent can I legally charge?</strong> If you set it too low, you leave money on the table. If you set it too high, your tenant refuses to pay, and you end up in dispute with the Rent Control Department.</p>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Under Act 220, rent must be "reasonable" and defensible against complaint. There's no fixed formula — it depends on:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8; margin:1.5rem 0;">
          <li>Location and neighborhood trends</li>
          <li>Property condition and age</li>
          <li>Amenities (water, electricity, security, parking)</li>
          <li>Tenure type (furnished, unfurnished, serviced)</li>
          <li>Similar properties in the area</li>
          <li>What the market is actually paying</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>This service does the research and analysis for you.</strong> We assess your property, compare it to similar rentals in your area, and give you a written, defensible rent position you can confidently use.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">What You Get</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Property Assessment:</strong> Review of your property's condition, location, and market position</li>
          <li><strong>Comparable Market Research:</strong> Analysis of 5–10 similar properties in your area</li>
          <li><strong>Written Valuation:</strong> Recommended rent range with clear reasoning</li>
          <li><strong>Act 220 Justification:</strong> Documentation showing how your recommended rent complies with law</li>
          <li><strong>Defensibility:</strong> A written position you can show to Rent Control if disputed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#fff3cd; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">When You Need This Service</h2>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li>You're setting rent for a new tenant</li>
          <li>You want to increase rent and need market justification</li>
          <li>A tenant has challenged your rent as unreasonable</li>
          <li>You own multiple properties and need consistency</li>
          <li>You're buying an investment property and need to know its rental potential</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#e8f4f8; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">The Real Cost of Getting It Wrong</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.8;">Guessing on rent can be expensive:</p>
        <ul style="line-height:1.8;">
          <li><strong>Too high:</strong> Tenant refuses to pay, you go to Rent Control, magistrate reduces the rent, you spend time and stress</li>
          <li><strong>Too low:</strong> You lose hundreds of thousands in cedis over the lease term</li>
          <li><strong>No documentation:</strong> If challenged, you can't explain or defend your rent figure</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="line-height:1.8; margin-top:1.5rem;"><strong>For GHS 200–400, you get peace of mind and a defensible position.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:2rem 0; padding:2rem; background:#f9f9f9; border-radius:8px;">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;">Pricing & Turnaround</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#516784; margin:0;">GHS 200 – 400</p>
        <p style="color:#666; margin:0.5rem 0;">Depends on property complexity and location research required</p>
        <p style="font-weight:600; margin-top:1rem;">Turnaround: 2–3 working days</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
        <a href="/services/" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#516784; color:white; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; margin-right:1rem;">Request a Quote</a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/233208071633" style="display:inline-block; padding:1rem 2rem; background:#f0f4f8; color:#516784; text-decoration:none; border-radius:4px; font-weight:600; border:1px solid #516784;">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
